[
  {
    "id": "dex-1-level-start-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Your name is on the guest list. Okafor sees a donor. Stay upright and keep the rig out of sight.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-1-level-start-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Loop the hall camera. Okafor stops along the west wall. Copy his badge from behind; leave the original on him.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-1-level-start-3",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Use the copy at the rear staff reader to book our night entry. Then leave through the lobby.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-1-level-start-4",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "And I choose the way out this time. There is a line waiting on the roof.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-1-pickpocket-complete-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Smooth. Original stays on his belt. Get the copy authorised at the rear staff reader.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "pickpocket:complete",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-1-evidence-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "A security roster. Dex is on it. Why would Dex be on it?",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-1-evidence-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Wren? You've gone quiet. Keep moving.",
    "level": "1",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-level-start-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "One-thirty. Same night. The badge got you inside; your donor cover is finished.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-level-start-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Cross the security corridor. Isolate the safe’s tamper circuit at the west service panel before touching the dial.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-door-tamper-circuit-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Tamper circuit isolated. Now the dial. Briggs is still making rounds.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "door:tamper-circuit",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-door-tamper-circuit-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "He checks the safe once a lap. Need longer? Bounce a decoy into the archive.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "door:tamper-circuit",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-hazard-trip-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Are you trying to set them off? Watch the pattern!",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "hazard:trip",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-hazard-trip-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Again? Crawl, jump or wait. It's not complicated.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "hazard:trip",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-player-detected-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Briggs has you! Move!",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-player-detected-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Seen. Of course. Hide, then hurry.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-safe-tumbler-1-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "One. Faster.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "safe:tumbler-1",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-safe-tumbler-2-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Two. Come on, come on.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "safe:tumbler-2",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-safe-miss-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "You're turning it like a radio dial. Slow. Down.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "safe:miss",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-safe-noise-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "That's loud. Briggs will hear that.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "safe:noise",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-2-evidence-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "A radio intercept on the guard channel. That's Dex's voice.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-evidence-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Leave the paperwork. We didn't come for paperwork.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-safe-opened-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Open. Take the Star, then get back to the service fire door.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "safe:opened",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-2-diamond-taken-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "I have it. Service door, then the roof.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "diamond:taken",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-2-diamond-taken-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Right. The service door. Keep moving.",
    "level": "2",
    "key": "diamond:taken",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-3-level-start-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Insurance pays better with a culprit. Sorry, Wren. Same as Marlowe.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-level-start-3",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Two-person interlock. My rig can replay the second operator’s signal. I can still reach my roof line.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "level:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-player-detected-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Seen. Move!",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-player-detected-2",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Not now. Not now.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "player:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-alarm-alert-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Keep breathing. Find the quiet route.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "alarm:alert",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-start-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Recording. Show me how it's done.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:start",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-replay-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "There I am. Still better company than Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:replay",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-echo-shattered-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "They broke my Echo. Again, then.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "echo:shattered",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-evidence-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "\"Leave the safecracker inside.\" Got you, Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "evidence",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-level-complete-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "One stone, one safecracker, no handler. Time to go.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "level:complete",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "wren-3-evidence-uploaded-1",
    "who": "WREN",
    "text": "Three files. Names, orders, payment. Sending it all. Your turn to wait for the police, Dex.",
    "level": "3",
    "key": "evidence:uploaded",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-loop-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "That feed's on a loop for eight seconds. Security is watching a very boring rerun.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:loop",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-detected-1",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "Camera's got you. Loop it or get out of its view.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-camera-detected-2",
    "who": "DEX",
    "text": "You're on camera, Wren. Smile, then move.",
    "level": "any",
    "key": "camera:detected",
    "direction": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "dex-any-player-detected-1",
